<h3 nodeId="27578267b718415db6c977a0dec28732">2.2 交互式配置规则</h3>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="31c63bd836214dad8c8080706592c0b8">
<tr nodeId="ab0ab8212ff44542bea7bb1c218c2186">
<th colwidth="[960]" nodeId="2659c78a1cb2492a801cbf5f3bd4035b">
<p nodeId="f6fad4216b0c492bbfbaa9c85daa4e76"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[753]" nodeId="3e04ca8902eb49f09f23a1f42b80c56b">
<p nodeId="2c8cfb47e1144fe8ab43d53fe32309c7"><span font-size="14">示意图</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="d407c52559d34600930e263acdf052e0">
<td colwidth="[960]" nodeId="aa80147435b04a739c9110fa204eda4a">
<p nodeId="be8be44e6f48408b80acb71242502958"><span font-size="16"><strong>1、首先填写规则逻辑信息，填写中文名称、英文名称、规则内容，此处通过设定左变量、右变量、操作符设置规则条件，并通过在下方条件间逻辑处书写与或表达式设定规则逻辑。</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="60ccbd1b80fe4e5cb29d576b82a65ac0" />
<p nodeId="ae51c2ff1c4a4e69888e5e96200fad04"><span font-size="14"><strong>填写说明：</strong></span></p>
<ol nodeId="93837e6168964b30b908740b4c22c496">
<li nodeId="797bb24414ed4011bb05851c4aa108be"><span font-size="14"><strong>规则内容配置：</strong></span><span font-size="14">通过设定规则条件、条件间逻辑确定一条规则逻辑。</span></li>
<li nodeId="253c840f8d704e728fc96708ee0bc8dd"><span font-size="14"><strong>英文名称：</strong></span><span font-size="14">驼峰命名，且仅支持小写字母，</span><span font-size="14"><strong>规则</strong></span><span color=""><span font-size="14"><strong>命名规范：</strong></span></span><span color=""><span font-size="14">rule_xxx_yyy_zzz，如rule_mac_is_not_has_owner表示规则是检验mac是否有对应厂商。</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="56c2a8011c9a4c3780aac2962f0db4c3">
<p nodeId="0808726d24a34332b45058c0f8780957"><span font-size="14"><strong>规则条件配置：</strong></span><span font-size="14">各名词含义说明如下：</span></p>
<ol nodeId="01e24e04bd764e11819cb74d89399cf9">
<li nodeId="b54c3524caa24f1ba3789f327fa94640"><span font-size="14">左变量：可选择在平台上注册过的参数/因子或使用函数对参数和因子做转换。</span></li>
<li nodeId="bc39407d9116401ab4453b35b3f3b509"><span font-size="14">操作符：一种判断，判断左右变量间的关系。具体操作符可见：</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1871709029#id-%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1871709029#id-%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="538b33d9333e441c8c30ea0fc97ee40f"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1871709029#id-%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6</span></a></li>
<li nodeId="6ca8f9c2af35483a8e65995328449fbb">
<p nodeId="b134aa9888ac4693b5160594470d6879"><span font-size="14">右变量：可选择 特征 和 常量</span></p>
<ol nodeId="146041f191a5473fab597c82f347b4e9">
<li nodeId="e3fe1ca0529a42aab362e3555a4588d0"><span font-size="14">特征：选择在平台上注册过的参数/因子</span></li>
<li nodeId="a903e42d102f41d4b9003c795d175b72"><span font-size="14">常量：选择左变量参数对应的枚举值或者自定义输入值</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="9c6e2b24974f4fe3a020e0b6438f4098"><span font-size="14"><strong>条件间逻辑</strong></span><span font-size="14">：</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.84)"><span font-size="14">规则逻辑由多个条件通过[与][或][非]连接。</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="3a79223f56d64a34816ba61e8595a893"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.84)"><span font-size="14"><strong>查看可视化计算逻辑：</strong></span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.84)"><span font-size="14">逻辑信息中设定的规则逻辑关系，以电路图的形式展示。</span></span></li>
</ol>
