<h2 align="start" nodeId="278f451bc8264881bfd915ce3344ad7d">step3：规则修改</h2>
<h3 nodeId="63407087c9de4364b55dd87be2817c5c">3.1 修改逻辑信息</h3>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="26c02945f3dd4a5286df44c65b7f7634">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="c9726fc751724fb98a59001cd0b81dab">注意：</p>
<p nodeId="f1c4ab97143a4f43833d851607faf9e9">此时若有其他人正在编辑该规则，您将收到提示xxmis号正在修改，需xx修改完成/退出编辑状态后，您方可修改。若您着急修改请大象联系该用户退出编辑状态。</p>
<p nodeId="696f44d34e44413d83fe2675ea6b1229"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/312585969/313704114?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="296" height="60" nodeId="ffc85adaa54b46e4915cc467d55cdc80" /></p>
