<h1 nodeId="cfb376d0f0d94c74932db3dd90beaf81">三、宣讲记录</h1>
<p nodeId="a88e291dff344c99af927b77787b98c6">20231030-规则交互式部署宣讲</p>
<km-video src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/312585969/67797969347?contentType=1" name="video1906737043.mp4" size="85.83MB" width="0" height="0" nodeId="6a44103741dd4ba28ab15ccfb64b1be6" />
<km-footnote-list nodeId="a2ca1fb62dc04eeb8058a2fc099e1a9e">
<km-footnote-item footnoteNodeId="b230c477585540f69a33ef185e53dd8f" nodeId="774fb7fa2573466193d07bec419ab33a"><p nodeId="8a3b829b50f54aaf9eb3daa80eec7278">交互式：交互式有什么好处？</p>
<p nodeId="0d7ebc3daf6e4d62b23ce7cd81040d86">1. 支持规则内短路执行，计算成本低</p>
<p nodeId="9eb91eb0e8a94018a583b27843391a3d">2. 左右变量操作符表征规则逻辑，可读性高</p>
<p nodeId="58721566de5746dc85d7376a4409aec1">3. 对于简单逻辑类规则，用户上手学习成本低</p></km-footnote-item>
